==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=Excrescence}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|excrescens|excrēscēns|lang=la}}, present participle of {{term|excresco|excrēscō|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something growing, usually abnormally, out of something else.
# {{context|phonetics|lang=en}} A sound in a word without [[etymological]] reason.
#: ''"B" in "nimble" is an '''excrescent'''.''

